factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  The draft headline and reel_script say 'இயற்கை எரு' (natural manure/fertilizer), but the article is about 'எருக்கன் இலை கரைசல்' (Calotropis leaf solution) used as a natural pest control spray; the product is mislabelled.
  The reel_script says 'இயற்கை எரு விளக்கம்' while the article's event is a demonstration of preparing an 'எருக்கன் இலை கரைசல்' for pest control and crop protection, not fertilizer.
  The reel_script and slides say the demonstration explained 'பூச்சிகளை இயற்கை முறையில் கட்டுப்படுத்தும் வழி' and pest control methods only in part; however the reel_script states students showed how to prepare the solution, which matches, but it omits that the event was held at a coconut orchard owner's grove in Punjaipugalur, which is included in slides only.
  The reel_script says students explained how to control 'இளம் இலைகளின் முறையற்ற வளர்ச்சி மற்றும் குரும்பைகள் உதிர்தல்' problems, but the article only says these problems were explained/awareness was created; it does not say how they are to be controlled, an invented detail.
  The reel_script says 'விவசாயிகள் தெரிவித்தனர்' that the solution can be prepared at low cost easily, attributing the statement to farmers; the article attributes low-cost/easy preparation to the students' demonstration, not to farmers.
  The reel_script says students 'கேட்டுக்கொண்டனர்' (urged) for early detection, which is a stronger framing than the article's 'விளக்கினர்' (explained).
  The caption says the event was held 'இயற்கை முறையில் பூச்சிகளை கட்டுப்படுத்தவும் பயிர் பாதுகாப்பிற்காகவும்' and the caption's 'மக்கள் கவனத்திற்கு' line says 'இயற்கை எரு' preparation, which mislabels the product as manure.
