factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script and slides_spec say the demonstration was held in the 'Punjai Pugalur' area of Karur, which the article does not state explicitly as a place for the event; the article's location is Punjai Pugalur within Karur district, so this is consistent, but the slides headline 'Punjai Pugalur' and the coconut-farmer framing 'தென்னை விவசாயிகளுக்கு' is an embellishment beyond the article's general 'farmers' wording
  The reel_script omits the names of the student presenters and the fact that they were final-year students of Karur Government Agricultural College and Research Station, which is an important part of 'who did what' (the reel says 'மாணவர்கள்' without the final-year detail)
  The caption says 'இறுதியாண்டு மாணவர்கள்' correctly, but the reel_script describes the event as 'இயற்கை முறை பூச்சிக் கட்டுப்பாட்டு செயல் விளக்கம்' while the article is primarily about preparing the Erukkan leaf solution; the slides claim farmers were taught to 'பூச்சிகளை கட்டுப்படுத்தும் வழிமுறை' which blends the pest-control and nutrient-deficiency topics into one unclear statement
  The slide 'விவசாயிகளுக்கு' ends with an incomplete sentence ('ஒருங்கிணைந்த பயிர் மேலாண்மையை') that has no clear meaning in Tamil
  The slide line 'எருக்கன் இலை கரைசல் தயாரிப்பு முறை காட்டப்பட்டது' and the reel's statement that the solution is used on coconut trees are fine, but the reel_script's sentence 'அதைத் தென்னை மரங்களுக்கு பயன்படுத்தும் முறையும் விளக்கப்பட்டது' mixes the solution-use demonstration with the nutrient-deficiency discussion without clearly separating the two facts
